$ agent-deck session link golden-sess-1
exit 1
--- stdout
Usage: agent-deck session link <session> issue|pr <number> [--repo [HOST/]OWNER/NAME]

Link a session to a GitHub issue or pull request. A session holds at most
one issue link and one PR link; linking again replaces the old one.
The TUI shows the link as a #12 / PR#34 badge on the session row.

Options:
--- stderr
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -repo string
    	Repo as OWNER/NAME or HOST/OWNER/NAME (default: the session checkout's origin, else its first GitHub remote by name)

